# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for code outside TapeFour.
# JUCE's MPESynthesiser takes its voice lock and its note lock in opposite orders in
# setCurrentPlaybackSampleRate() and noteAdded(). TapeFour only prepares an instrument before the
# audio thread can see it, or while audio is stopped, so the two orders never overlap.
deadlock:juce::MPESynthesiser::setCurrentPlaybackSampleRate
